{"n":18,"title":"Have you heard?","blurb":"Present Perfect with just / already / yet; giving and reacting to news","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Somebody sends you this message. Is it good news, bad news, or does it depend?","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"good"},{"label":"bad"},{"label":"it depends"},{"label":"good"},{"label":"bad"},{"label":"it depends"},{"label":"good"},{"label":"bad"},{"label":"it depends"},{"label":"good"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"dishonest","pos":"adj","ru":"нечестный","kk":"адал емес","def":"not telling the truth; ready to cheat","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-dishonest.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/e3c95af2905c.mp3"},{"en":"disorganized","pos":"adj","ru":"неорганизованный","kk":"ұйымдаспаған","def":"bad at planning and at keeping things in order","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-disorganized.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/c0f945ae7add.mp3"},{"en":"impatient","pos":"adj","ru":"нетерпеливый","kk":"шыдамсыз","def":"not able to wait calmly","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-impatient.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/9ed7f1307589.mp3"},{"en":"impolite","pos":"adj","ru":"невежливый","kk":"әдепсіз","def":"not showing good manners towards other people","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-impolite.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/cbb7028dc628.mp3"},{"en":"impossible","pos":"adj","ru":"невозможный","kk":"мүмкін емес","def":"that cannot happen or be done","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-impossible.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/a708dd233307.mp3"},{"en":"unfair","pos":"adj","ru":"несправедливый","kk":"әділетсіз","def":"not treating people equally or reasonably","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unfair.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/ee50a54d0fd6.mp3"},{"en":"unfriendly","pos":"adj","ru":"недружелюбный","kk":"достық емес","def":"not kind or pleasant towards other people","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unfriendly.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/bada75724f8d.mp3"},{"en":"unkind","pos":"adj","ru":"недобрый","kk":"мейірімсіз","def":"not caring about other people’s feelings","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unkind.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/ca4339ee5842.mp3"},{"en":"unlucky","pos":"adj","ru":"невезучий","kk":"сәтсіз","def":"having bad luck","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unlucky.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/a6c6f227f653.mp3"},{"en":"unnecessary","pos":"adj","ru":"ненужный","kk":"қажетсіз","def":"not needed","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unnecessary.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/ddc3632832fa.mp3"},{"en":"unpleasant","pos":"adj","ru":"неприятный","kk":"жағымсыз","def":"not enjoyable; making you feel bad","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unpleasant.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/5cb4fe01e858.mp3"},{"en":"unsociable","pos":"adj","ru":"необщительный","kk":"көпшіл емес","def":"not enjoying the company of other people","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-unsociable.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/74453a13c789.mp3"},{"en":"untidy","pos":"adj","ru":"неопрятный","kk":"ретсіз","def":"not neat, with things left out of place","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-untidy.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/5c124dd68605.mp3"},{"en":"necessary","pos":"adj","ru":"нужный","kk":"қажет","def":"needed in order to do something","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-necessary.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/fce3b4d725ee.mp3"},{"en":"possible","pos":"adj","ru":"возможный","kk":"мүмкін","def":"that can happen or be done","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-possible.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/db7c8cf91385.mp3"},{"en":"usual","pos":"adj","ru":"обычный","kk":"әдеттегі","def":"happening most of the time; normal","img":"/course/a2/img/l18-usual.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/bf9ebd700b51.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"dishonest","options":["нечестный","неорганизованный","нетерпеливый","невежливый","невозможный"],"answer":"нечестный","optionsKk":["адал емес","ұйымдаспаған","шыдамсыз","әдепсіз","мүмкін емес"],"answerKk":"адал емес"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"disorganized","options":["неорганизованный","недружелюбный","недобрый","невезучий","ненужный"],"answer":"неорганизованный","optionsKk":["ұйымдаспаған","достық емес","мейірімсіз","сәтсіз","қажетсіз"],"answerKk":"ұйымдаспаған"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"impatient","options":["нетерпеливый","необщительный","неопрятный","нужный","возможный"],"answer":"нетерпеливый","optionsKk":["шыдамсыз","көпшіл емес","ретсіз","қажет","мүмкін"],"answerKk":"шыдамсыз"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"impolite","options":["невежливый","невозможный","несправедливый","недружелюбный","недобрый"],"answer":"невежливый","optionsKk":["әдепсіз","мүмкін емес","әділетсіз","достық емес","мейірімсіз"],"answerKk":"әдепсіз"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"impossible","options":["невозможный","неприятный","необщительный","неопрятный","нужный"],"answer":"невозможный","optionsKk":["мүмкін емес","жағымсыз","көпшіл емес","ретсіз","қажет"],"answerKk":"мүмкін емес"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выбери правильный перевод","prompt":"unfair","options":["несправедливый","недружелюбный","недобрый","невезучий","ненужный"],"answer":"несправедливый","optionsKk":["әділетсіз","достық емес","мейірімсіз","сәтсіз","қажетсіз"],"answerKk":"әділетсіз"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"<p class=\"s-en\">I&rsquo;ve <b>just</b> passed my driving test.</p><p class=\"s-note\" data-t=\"sx085\"><b>just</b> = a moment ago. It goes between <i>have</i> and the participle.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"<p class=\"s-en\">I&rsquo;ve <b>already</b> called her.</p><p class=\"s-note\"><b>already</b> = sooner than expected. Same position: after <i>have</i>.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Как это работает","html":"<p class=\"s-en\">Have you told your mum <b>yet</b>?</p><p class=\"s-note\"><b>yet</b> lives at the <b>end</b>, and only in questions and negatives.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"choice","title":"","prompt":"Where does yet go, and what kind of sentence is it in?","options":["after have , in positive sentences","at the end, in positive sentences","at the end, in questions and negatives","anywhere — it does not matter"],"answer":"at the end, in questions and negatives"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"choice","title":"Listen. The same three words, said twice. Which one sounds genuinely excited?","prompt":"Version a Version b","options":["a is the excited one","b is the excited one","neither of these"],"answer":"a is the excited one"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"Have you finished the report ____ ?","options":["yet","already","neither of these"],"answer":"yet"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"I’ve ____ sent the email.","options":["yet","already","neither of these"],"answer":"already"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"She hasn’t replied ____ .","options":["yet","just","neither of these"],"answer":"yet"},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Choose the correct word.","prompt":"He’s ____ walked through the door.","options":["just","yet","neither of these"],"answer":"just"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Read the news. Write your reaction and one follow-up question with yet .","sub":"Напиши ответ, затем проверь себя","placeholder":"Твой ответ…","model":"something you have just done"},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Отметь, чему научился","sub":"Я могу…","items":["say something happened a moment ago — I’ve just…","say it happened sooner than expected — I’ve already…","ask and say “not so far” — Have you … yet? / I haven’t … yet","give good news and bad news — Guess what! Have you heard…?","react to both — Congratulations! That’s fantastic! Oh no! What a shame!","make an adjective negative — un-, im-, dis-"]}]}